      <description><![CDATA[<b>Land:</b> Norwegen<br/><b>Vassdrag:</b> Loneelva<br/><b>Kategori:</b> Utløp - kategorisert vassdrag<br/><b>Regel (nasjonal munningsfredningssone, 100 m):</b> Fra grensen mellom elv og sjø og 100 meter utover er alt fiske forbudt når elven/sjøen er stengt for fiske etter laks/sjøørret/sjørøye. Når vassdraget er åpent for fiske, er det i munningsfredningssonen kun tillatt å fiske med stang og håndsnøre etter anadrome laksefisk.<br/><b>Hinweis:</b> Fangstzeiten (Åpningstider) variieren pro Gewässer und werden jährlich von Miljødirektoratet/Statsforvalteren festgelegt – siehe lakseregistrert.no bzw. miljodirektoratet.no.<br/><b>Rechtsgrundlage:</b> Lakse- og innlandsfiskloven, forskrift om fiske etter anadrome laksefisk i sjøen (Elveutløp-Datensatz, Fiskeridirektoratet/Miljødirektoratet)<br/><b>Geometrie:</b> Exakter Mündungspunkt (amtlich) + 100-m-Radius nach nationaler Regel (Radius selbst ist keine Geodatenangabe, sondern aus der Vorschrift abgeleitet)]]></description>
      <Polygon><tessellate>1</tessellate><outerBoundaryIs><LinearRing><coordinates>5.144185,61.294804,0 5.144429,61.294797,0 5.144668,61.294774,0 5.144899,61.294736,0 5.145118,61.294684,0 5.145321,61.294619,0 5.145504,61.294541,0 5.145665,61.294453,0 5.145801,61.294356,0 5.145908,61.294250,0 5.145987,61.294139,0 5.146034,61.294024,0 5.146050,61.293907,0 5.146034,61.293790,0 5.145987,61.293675,0 5.145908,61.293564,0 5.145800,61.293458,0 5.145665,61.293361,0 5.145504,61.293272,0 5.145321,61.293195,0 5.145118,61.293130,0 5.144899,61.293078,0 5.144668,61.293040,0 5.144428,61.293017,0 5.144185,61.293010,0 5.143942,61.293017,0 5.143702,61.293040,0 5.143471,61.293078,0 5.143252,61.293130,0 5.143049,61.293195,0 5.142866,61.293272,0 5.142705,61.293361,0 5.142570,61.293458,0 5.142462,61.293564,0 5.142383,61.293675,0 5.142336,61.293790,0 5.142320,61.293907,0 5.142336,61.294024,0 5.142383,61.294139,0 5.142462,61.294250,0 5.142569,61.294356,0 5.142705,61.294453,0 5.142866,61.294541,0 5.143049,61.294619,0 5.143252,61.294684,0 5.143471,61.294736,0 5.143702,61.294774,0 5.143942,61.294797,0 5.144185,61.294804,0</coordinates></LinearRing></outerBoundaryIs></Polygon>
